        "current": "\nThe source now enforces ERC-5192 permanent locking on `DynastyNFT`. Minting, signed-voucher checks and metadata remain available. Existing portrait snapshots and indexer reconciliation remain for historical data; the new contract cannot create owner-to-owner transfers. Existing immutable deployments do not acquire soulbinding from this source change.\n\nThe deed limit counts identities, including extracted and redeemed deeds. A transfer, death, burn-back into the game, or re-extraction of the same street does not free or consume an additional identity slot. Onchain enforcement is a fixed 2,500 maximum and monotonic unique-street counter. In-game creation uses a serialized lifetime counter seeded from existing streets, including extracted rows. Acquisition update — 30 October 2026: 1,000 canonical lots are reserved for gameplay discovery at level 25+, 1,000 for paid minting and 500 for partnerships. One account has one lifetime gameplay claim. Operating benefits require level 25 for every acquisition route. Existing ownership, trading and inheritance remain intact. The app release does not activate NFT issuance or invent a release schedule; matching contracts and verified configuration are required separately.\n\nThe character identity currently represents an account's bloodline and persists across generations. The proposed custody system gives each mortal character life its own account while retaining that persistent soulbound identity:\n\n",
